<title>GERMANY: Hoechst wants to buy rest of Roussel Uclaf.</title>
<headline>Hoechst wants to buy rest of Roussel Uclaf.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemical firm Hoechst AG said on Tuesday it would put forward an offer to buy the minority stake of French pharmaceuticals subsidiary Roussel Uclaf which it does not already own.</p>
</text>
